        "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heist Haven is currently available in Early Access! This roadmap outlines some of the content being worked and launching in the coming year. This plan is not set in stone and might change.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>December 2025:</strong> Minor Update - Christmas Update &amp; QOL improvements.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q1 2026:</strong> Major Update #1 - New Heists, Vehicles and Weapons! Financial Area finished, including the heists there.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q2</strong> <strong>2026:</strong> Major Update #2 - Desert Area finished with new heists, including the Casino Heist and Area 53 Heist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q3 2026:</strong> Major Update #3 - Historic District finished with new heists, including the Art Museum Heist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q4 2026:</strong> Full Release: The game launches out of Early Access!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beyond:</strong> Bug-fixes, support and player suggestions will all still be worked on throughout the game's lifespan.</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heist Haven is a 1 to 4-player co-op online shooter set in the open-world criminal paradise of  Haven.</strong> <strong>Assemble your crew, select your gear and customise your character: the next big score is waiting!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FPS Heists &amp; Missions:</strong> Team up with friends or go solo to plan and execute high-stakes heists—complete Jobs and Missions for your criminal contacts to work your way up on the criminal ladder.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Co-op Gameplay:</strong> Play Solo or Team up with a crew of up to 4 Robbers online.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vast Open World:</strong> Heists take place in locations inside the open world, which is explorable at your leisure and filled with secrets and surprises. Heists are only finished when the loot is delivered to a drop-off point and you have returned to your hideout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level up your Character &amp; Crew:</strong> Create, customise and level up your Character. Progress through the world and unlock new equipment and vehicles by levelling up your Crew.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Weapons:</strong> Equip yourself with a wide range of weapons, gadgets, and vehicles tailored to your playstyle. Upgrade your gear and develop unique strategies to outsmart your foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat Varied Enemies:</strong> From your average cop to tactical SWAT teams, experienced army units and even Helicopters and Jet Fighters, Heist Haven is filled with plenty of adversaries to test your capabilities.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Varied Vehicles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334410/extras/b474fd1fbde2cbed2391cb5825a97af6.poster.avif?t=1764158461\" aria-label=\"Spinning showcase of vehicles in the game\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334410/extras/b474fd1fbde2cbed2391cb5825a97af6.webm?t=1764158461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334410/extras/b474fd1fbde2cbed2391cb5825a97af6.mp4?t=1764158461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lots of Weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334410/extras/d19b97444fe03f9d27d47562d2114fdb.poster.avif?t=1764158461\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334410/extras/d19b97444fe03f9d27d47562d2114fdb.webm?t=1764158461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334410/extras/d19b97444fe03f9d27d47562d2114fdb.mp4?t=1764158461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heist Haven is a 1 to 4-player co-op online shooter set in the open-world criminal paradise of  Haven.</strong> <strong>Assemble your crew, select your gear and customise your character: the next big score is waiting!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FPS Heists &amp; Missions:</strong> Team up with friends or go solo to plan and execute high-stakes heists—complete Jobs and Missions for your criminal contacts to work your way up on the criminal ladder.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Co-op Gameplay:</strong> Play Solo or Team up with a crew of up to 4 Robbers online.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vast Open World:</strong> Heists take place in locations inside the open world, which is explorable at your leisure and filled with secrets and surprises. Heists are only finished when the loot is delivered to a drop-off point and you have returned to your hideout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level up your Character &amp; Crew:</strong> Create, customise and level up your Character. Progress through the world and unlock new equipment and vehicles by levelling up your Crew.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Weapons:</strong> Equip yourself with a wide range of weapons, gadgets, and vehicles tailored to your playstyle. Upgrade your gear and develop unique strategies to outsmart your foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat Varied Enemies:</strong> From your average cop to tactical SWAT teams, experienced army units and even Helicopters and Jet Fighters, Heist Haven is filled with plenty of adversaries to test your capabilities.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Varied Vehicles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334410/extras/b474fd1fbde2cbed2391cb5825a97af6.poster.avif?t=1764158461\" aria-label=\"Spinning showcase of vehicles in the game\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334410/extras/b474fd1fbde2cbed2391cb5825a97af6.webm?t=1764158461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334410/extras/b474fd1fbde2cbed2391cb5825a97af6.mp4?t=1764158461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lots of Weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334410/extras/d19b97444fe03f9d27d47562d2114fdb.poster.avif?t=1764158461\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334410/extras/d19b97444fe03f9d27d47562d2114fdb.webm?t=1764158461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334410/extras/d19b97444fe03f9d27d47562d2114fdb.mp4?t=1764158461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
